# Third-party mod jars we compile against.
#
# These are NOT ours to redistribute. IC2 Classic in particular ships as
# "All rights reserved", so publishing a copy here would be straightforward
# unauthorised redistribution. Every jar in libs/ is compileOnly and is never
# bundled into our output, so nothing is lost by leaving them out.
#
# See the "Building" section of README.md for where to get them.
libs/*.jar
